392
00:15:57,130 --> 00:15:57,770
¡Tailow!

393
00:15:58,090 --> 00:15:58,270
¡Tailow!

394
00:15:58,590 --> 00:15:58,690
¡Tailow!

395
00:15:59,090 --> 00:16:01,670
No me digan que todos quieren pelear con

396
00:16:01,670 --> 00:16:02,170
