397
00:16:02,970 --> 00:16:04,010
Es una posibilidad.

398
00:16:05,490 --> 00:16:07,310
¡Tailow, Tailow, Tailow!

399
00:16:08,410 --> 00:16:10,650
No nos vas a convencer, Tailow.

400
00:16:11,410 --> 00:16:13,290
